# One total rule, not per-extension patterns: this checkout is read by git on
# Windows hosts AND inside Linux containers, and any text file the patterns
# missed (this one, the first time) checks out CRLF on Windows and then reads
# as eternally modified from the container side -- which poisons the report's
# dirty-tree check. Everything here is text; auto spares any future binary.
* text=auto eol=lf
